# Per-Dockerfile ignore file for docker/sandbox/Dockerfile (ADR-038/ADR-039) —
# Docker resolves this automatically from its path relative to the build
# context (repo root, `docker build -f docker/sandbox/Dockerfile .`), same
# mechanism the root `.dockerignore` documents. This sandbox image doesn't
# COPY `case_study/` (only the root Dockerfile does), so it's safe to exclude
# here for a smaller build context — excluding it from the shared root
# `.dockerignore` broke that Dockerfile's own build (see its comment).

.git/
.venv/
venv/
node_modules/
frontend/
.claude/
docs/
case_study/
tests/
.env
.env.local
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
htmlcov/
